WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.373
Are we safe?

00:02.073 --> 00:04.027
For the large ones, yes.

00:04.477 --> 00:14.354
The vast majority of the asteroids bigger than a kilometre have been found, and none of the forty thousand known is a threat in the next hundred years.

00:14.804 --> 00:18.614
But only about a third of the middle-sized ones have been found.

00:19.064 --> 00:20.738
The search goes on.
